      "t": "After looking around the modest flat, Max agrees to rent it, only for the landlady to tell him she rents exclusively to girls. Meanwhile, Chef Barinov shares a drink and wartime stories with Kirill Ilyich to restore peace. Listen to the Russian scene first, and then we will go through every line.",
      "gap": 0.8
    },
